Troubleshooting
Common Issues:

Library not found: Ensure library paths are correct using ldconfig -p | grep libname
Symbol not found: Verify symbol exists using nm -D /path/to/library.so | grep symbol
Compilation errors: Check that all required headers are installed with apt install libc6-dev
